 shifter form  aaron first unlocks the ability to  transform into the attack titan during  the battle of trost when he is swallowed  and nearly killed by a pure titan the  anguish and desperation that aaron feels  in this moment as he witnesses his  comrades dying and being devoured by  this same titan triggers aaron's first  transformation into the attack titan he  turns into a titan inside the titan who  consumed him and so aaron's  transformation tears the other titan  apart in case you're wondering why the  pure titan that consumed aaron didn't  become a titan shifter himself it is  because he still hadn't killed aaron and  consumed his spinal fluid aaron had not  been digested yet and so he was able to  transform before being completely  devoured as i said earlier aaron's  attack titan form is very different from  his pure titan this titan is 15 meters  tall so much bigger than his 4 meter  pure titan and rather than being stocky  his body is extremely athletic and  muscular initially aaron has no  conscious control while in his attack  titan form and he also has no clear  memory of what he did as a titan so his  titan functions on pure instinct and the  driving instinct for him is to kill  every titan at all costs so in pursuit  of this goal aaron's attack titan  overexerts himself and even injures his  own body in the process of killing other  titans on top of transforming into a  titan fully aaron is also able to  perform a partial titan transformation  for example he protects mikasayan armin  from a cannonball by creating an  incomplete torso titan and erecting it  as a protective barrier after multiple  transformations aaron becomes more  accustomed to being on titan shifter and  he progressively becomes more capable of  controlling his titan form it is clear  from the start that aaron's titan is  more physically powerful than the  average titan and this is shown multiple  times in the early stages of the story  aaron's titan is able to take down as  many 